<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Depreciation
expense for the nine months ended September 30, 2023 was $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20230101__20230930_zzhlSm5f4XOl" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-09-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">410,593</ix:nonFraction></span> and for the nine months ended September 30, 2022 was $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20220101__20220930_z6BElPDQzFZd" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-09-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">304,287</ix:nonFraction></span>. Depreciation
expense for the three months ended September 30, 2023 was $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20230701__20230930_zU9VcQ5sFsUb" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2023-07-012023-09-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">154,663</ix:nonFraction></span> and for the three months ended September 30, 2022 was $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20220701__20220930_zntr1DnSQpl1" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2022-07-012022-09-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">101,429</ix:nonFraction></span>.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>


